OL,3,GNEWSAVandalised care home to be
OL,4,Areacquired by council
OL,5,
OL,6,FA vandalised former care home is to be
OL,7,Freacquired by a council after becoming
OL,8,Fa "blight" on a town.
OL,10,FFeryemount on North Street in Ferryhill
OL,11,Fhas been repeatedly targeted in recent
OL,12,Fyears, with smashed windows and
OL,13,Fgraffiti.
OL,15,FLocal Reform UK councillor Joe Quinn
OL,16,Fsaid while the council had made the
OL,17,Fbuilding secure it was not a long-term
OL,18,Fsolution, having spent nearly #30,000
OL,19,Fkeeping the property safe.
